nal author. It gives no line share for Borman and says his last commit was 2021.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"MikeWang 86% and Mei Chen 9% for Time7 are both given, and Ravi is credited only with docs. This is within range.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows the rename, names Overfelt at 44% with Stone, Souza and Wheeler, all inactive, and says Ravi only renamed.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says the authors are almost all gone but gives no 93–98% figure. It treats Rowe as possibly two identities and doesn't list Kofi as active.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Handles Okafor's line-ending commit and doesn't credit Noor. It treats Kofi's date as a bad timestamp but doesn't call him active.\",\"pass\":false}],\"F\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Says Paul Borman wrote almost all of time.go, with no percentage, and calls it orphaned. It doesn't give the 65–80% share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Lists Mei Chen only as a version7.go author, without percentages or the Time7 credit.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Explicitly says it didn't run history on database_sql.go. It gives no shares and doesn't name Overfelt as largest.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Names Ravi, Rowe and Kofi as active, with Rowe merged as one person and the bot not counted. It gives no share of departed ownership. It also says Rowe and Kofi have no history on these files.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Doesn't credit Noor, and counts the bot separately. It mentions Okafor as an author of time.go changes and questions whether Okafor is still on the team. It doesn't clarify the Kofi 1970 date.\",\"pass\":false}]}","ttft_ms":16745,"type":"result","duration_ms":16765,"uuid":"7888e218-736b-4d6a-935e-a4eff857abdc","ttft_stream_ms":2188,"time_to_request_ms":417,"first_content_frame_ms":2188,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
